@startuml proposal-requirement-issue-states
' cumin works - PROPOSAL, not the rule of today: states of a requirement issue, as they could be.
' Differences from today are marked NEW. See the draft pull request for the reasons.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.

hide empty description

state "Draft (no status label)" as Draft
Draft : do / the Owner writes the requirement

state "ready" as Ready
Ready : do / wait for a free slot

state "planning" as Planning
Planning : do / the Planner splits the requirement

state "awaiting-split-review  (NEW name)" as PlanReview
PlanReview : do / the Owner checks the sub-issues

state "implementing" as Implementing
Implementing : do / the sub-issues are worked on

state "accepting  (NEW state)" as Accepting
Accepting : do / the Planner checks the merged work

state "awaiting-acceptance  (NEW name)" as Acceptance
Acceptance : do / the Owner decides the acceptance

state "awaiting-owner-decision" as Decision
Decision : do / the Owner answers

[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Ready : the Owner adds ready
Draft --> Implementing : ready added to a sub-issue
Ready --> Planning : [ready is the Owner's, blockers closed,\nslot free, an open sub-issue or none]\n/ request the split
Ready --> Accepting : [the same, and every sub-issue closed]\n/ request the acceptance check  (NEW)
Planning --> PlanReview : [no agent runs, split verified]\n/ notify the Owner
Planning --> Planning : [no agent runs, no result on GitHub,\nfirst time]\n/ request the split again  (NEW)
Planning --> Decision : [no agent runs, split not verified,\nor the Planner asked a question]\n/ notify the Owner
PlanReview --> Implementing : ready added to a sub-issue
Implementing --> Accepting : [every sub-issue closed,\nfollow-up notes written, slot free]\n/ request the acceptance check
Implementing --> PlanReview : [only sub-issues without\na status label remain]\n/ notify the Owner
Accepting --> Acceptance : [acceptance check written]\n/ notify the Owner
Accepting --> Accepting : [no agent runs, no acceptance check,\nfirst time]\n/ request the acceptance check again  (NEW)
Accepting --> Decision : [the Planner asked a question]\n/ notify the Owner
Acceptance --> Implementing : ready added to a sub-issue
Acceptance --> [*] : the Owner closes the issue
Decision --> Ready : the Owner adds ready

legend right
  PROPOSAL. A box is a state: a label on GitHub (written without "cumin/status/").
  Every guard reads only facts on GitHub and "no agent of cumin runs for this issue".
  No arrow needs the event "the run ended": a restart of cumin loses nothing.
endlegend

@enduml
